Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-p1-I3-1793157452/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
Reports to: root (the human)
Your team (fixed by the plan; you cannot change it):
